</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left"><p align="left" style="margin-left:0pt;text-align:left;" class="MsoNormal">RDF</p></td><td valign="top"><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_4a619266-b7f2-0c43-5c4c-6879bbbcc20f" id="_4a619266-b7f2-0c43-5c4c-6879bbbcc20f"></a>Resource Description Framework</p>
